cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SMRITI in your research or product, please cite it as below."
title: "SMRITI: Structured Memory with Reflective Indexing and Temporal Inference"
type: software
url: "https://github.com/vn-envy/Smriti"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vn-envy/Smriti"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.2
date-released: 2026-07-17
abstract: >-
  A zero-infrastructure, local-first, bi-temporal memory layer for AI agents.
  One SQLite file; stdlib + numpy dependency surface; supersession instead of
  deletion; four-channel hybrid retrieval with named, evidence-carrying
  retrieval profiles; benchmark harness included.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - memory
  - retrieval
  - sqlite
  - temporal-reasoning
  - local-first
